## HTTP Server Did Not Accept Commands

### Symptom

Typing commands appeared to have no effect.

Pressing Enter moved the cursor but commands were not executed.

### Cause

The terminal was occupied by:

```bash
python3 -m http.server 8000
```

which runs continuously until stopped.

### Resolution

Terminate current process:

```text
Ctrl+C
```

or

```bash
pkill -f http.server
```

### Lesson Learned

Always confirm shell prompt has returned before entering another command.

