## TCP Stream Binding Failure

### Symptom

Running:

```bash
rpicam-vid -t 0 --inline --listen -o tcp://0.0.0.0:8888
```

produced:

```text
failed to bind listen socket
```

### Cause

Port 8888 was already occupied by a previous streaming process.

### Investigation

Checked active processes:

```bash
ps aux | grep rpicam
```

### Resolution

Terminate existing stream:

```bash
pkill -f rpicam-vid
```

Restart on unused port:

```bash
rpicam-vid -t 0 --inline --listen -o tcp://0.0.0.0:9999
```

### Outcome

Video stream launched successfully.

