## Tailscale Installation Failure

### Symptom

Running:

```bash
sudo tailscale up
```

returned:

```text
sudo: tailscale: command not found
```

### Cause

Tailscale had not yet been installed on Raspberry Pi.

Phone-side installation and authentication completed successfully.

### Diagnosis

Verify installation:

```bash
which tailscale
```

### Planned Resolution

```bash
curl -fsSL https://tailscale.com/install.sh | sh
```

followed by:

```bash
sudo tailscale up
```

### Status

Pending.

